WEBVTT

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:07.360
(splutters)

00:00:08.361 --> 00:00:10.280
Dude, you're awesome.

00:00:10.363 --> 00:00:11.615
You're like the brother I never had.

00:00:11.698 --> 00:00:12.991
Me, too.

00:00:17.037 --> 00:00:18.288
(short grunt)

00:00:19.623 --> 00:00:20.749
(sniffing)

00:00:21.458 --> 00:00:22.459
Whoa.

00:00:22.542 --> 00:00:23.627
(chuckles)

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:25.587
(Crash and Eddie gasp, weasel groans)

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:27.422
Can we keep him?

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:29.841
(Manny screams)

00:00:29.925 --> 00:00:31.885
-Buck.
-What?

00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:33.470
The name's Buck.

00:00:33.553 --> 00:00:35.305
Short for Buckminster.

00:00:35.847 --> 00:00:37.224
Long for...

00:00:37.307 --> 00:00:38.808
(echoing):
...Buh.

00:00:38.892 --> 00:00:40.644
-Aah...
-Hmm.

00:00:40.727 --> 00:00:42.103
A little dull.

00:00:43.813 --> 00:00:45.607
What are you doing here?

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.609
Our friend was taken by a dinosaur.

00:00:47.692 --> 00:00:49.903
Well... he's dead.

00:00:49.986 --> 00:00:51.279
Welcome to my world.

00:00:51.363 --> 00:00:52.864
Now, uh, go home.

00:00:53.365 --> 00:00:54.282
Off you pop.

00:00:54.366 --> 00:00:55.367
Not without Sid.

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:56.493
Ellie, wait.

00:00:56.576 --> 00:00:58.787
Maybe the deranged hermit has a point.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:00.622
Manny, we came this far.

00:01:00.705 --> 00:01:01.706
We're going to find him.

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:03.416
DIEGO:
I got tracks.

00:01:05.335 --> 00:01:08.004
Let's go.

00:01:08.088 --> 00:01:09.422
Whoa!

00:01:09.506 --> 00:01:12.509
If you go in there,
you'll find your friend...

00:01:12.592 --> 00:01:14.803
in the afterlife.

00:01:14.886 --> 00:01:15.845
EDDIE:
How do you know,

00:01:15.929 --> 00:01:18.348
oh great and wisely weaselly one?

00:01:18.974 --> 00:01:21.184
(branch cranks)

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:27.774
(spits)
Mm, yeah, mm.

00:01:27.857 --> 00:01:30.360
Mommy dinosaur carrying
her three babies

00:01:30.443 --> 00:01:33.530
and some floppy green thing.

00:01:33.613 --> 00:01:35.907
Yeah, we're friends with
the floppy green thing.

00:01:35.991 --> 00:01:37.993
You got all that from the tracks?

00:01:38.076 --> 00:01:39.286
No, not really.

00:01:39.369 --> 00:01:40.704
I saw 'em come through here earlier.

00:01:40.787 --> 00:01:43.498
She's headed for Lava Falls.

00:01:43.582 --> 00:01:46.126
That's where they care for the newborns.

00:01:46.209 --> 00:01:50.630
To get there, you've got to go
through the Jungle of Misery,

00:01:50.714 --> 00:01:53.508
across the Chasm of Death...

00:01:54.884 --> 00:01:58.096
...to the Plates of Woe.

00:01:59.055 --> 00:02:00.557
-Whoa.
-Whoa.

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:01.725
Okay.

00:02:01.808 --> 00:02:04.728
Good luck with the slow
descent into madness.

00:02:04.811 --> 00:02:05.770
We're going to go now.

00:02:05.854 --> 00:02:08.023
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:02:08.106 --> 00:02:09.524
Whoa.

00:02:09.608 --> 00:02:12.736
What, you, y-y-you think this is
some sort of tropical getaway?

00:02:12.819 --> 00:02:15.780
You can't protect your mate, mate.

00:02:15.864 --> 00:02:17.449
What are you going to do with those,

00:02:17.532 --> 00:02:19.242
those flimsy tusks

00:02:19.326 --> 00:02:22.412
when you run into the beast?

00:02:22.495 --> 00:02:23.455
(both gasp)

00:02:23.538 --> 00:02:27.000
I call him... Rudy.

00:02:27.083 --> 00:02:28.543
Oh, good, good.

00:02:28.627 --> 00:02:30.920
I was worried
it was something intimidating

00:02:31.004 --> 00:02:33.923
like, uh, Sheldon or Tim.

00:02:34.007 --> 00:02:36.176
Wait, you mean
there's something bigger

00:02:36.259 --> 00:02:37.594
than Mommy Dinosaur?

00:02:37.677 --> 00:02:39.554
-Aye.
-Eye?

00:02:39.638 --> 00:02:40.847
Aye, aye.

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:43.224
He's the one that gave me this.

00:02:43.308 --> 00:02:45.810
Whoa, he gave you that patch?

00:02:45.894 --> 00:02:46.811
For free?

00:02:46.895 --> 00:02:48.438
That's so cool.

00:02:48.521 --> 00:02:50.398
Yeah, maybe he'll give us one, too.

00:02:50.482 --> 00:02:51.900
(both laughing excitedly)

00:02:51.983 --> 00:02:53.443
-Hoo, hoo, hoo, hoo, hoo...
-(Crash humming)

00:02:53.526 --> 00:02:55.236
...hoo, hoo, hoo, hoo.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:57.322
Welcome to my world.

00:03:00.617 --> 00:03:03.495
Abandon all hope, he who enters there.

00:03:03.578 --> 00:03:05.580
MANNY:
All right, we get it.

00:03:05.664 --> 00:03:10.251
Doom and despair, yada yada yada.

00:03:10.335 --> 00:03:11.878
(panting)

00:03:11.961 --> 00:03:14.172
(straining)

00:03:20.845 --> 00:03:24.599
(grunting)

00:03:24.683 --> 00:03:25.809
(exclaims)

00:03:25.892 --> 00:03:28.103
(groans)

00:03:28.186 --> 00:03:29.229
(short grunt)

00:03:29.312 --> 00:03:31.064
(grunting)

00:03:32.816 --> 00:03:34.609
(sighs)

00:03:34.693 --> 00:03:35.568
(gasps)

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:38.738
(straining)

00:03:38.822 --> 00:03:39.656
(panting)

00:03:39.739 --> 00:03:42.701
(straining)

00:03:48.665 --> 00:03:49.874
Oh...

00:03:49.958 --> 00:03:51.292
(rumbling)

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:54.921
(straining)

00:03:55.004 --> 00:03:58.466
(grunting frantically)

00:03:58.550 --> 00:03:59.467
(screams)

00:03:59.551 --> 00:04:01.010
(straining)

00:04:01.094 --> 00:04:02.512
(whimpers)

00:04:02.595 --> 00:04:04.013
Hmm.

00:04:04.806 --> 00:04:07.684
(panting frantically)

00:04:10.353 --> 00:04:12.355
(whimpering)

00:04:14.524 --> 00:04:16.484
(screaming)

00:04:16.568 --> 00:04:18.528
(scream echoing)

00:04:22.115 --> 00:04:25.744
Sounds like a jungle of misery to me.

00:04:30.915 --> 00:04:34.085
(slithering)

00:04:35.211 --> 00:04:37.046
Huh?

00:04:38.631 --> 00:04:39.549
Hold on.

00:04:39.632 --> 00:04:41.217
Why? What's wrong?

00:04:41.301 --> 00:04:44.512
-Peaches?
-What? No.

00:04:44.596 --> 00:04:46.890
It's just...
I got a funny feeling.

00:04:46.973 --> 00:04:49.350
You're hungry-- low blood sugar.

00:04:49.434 --> 00:04:50.894
Well, there's some fruit.

00:04:50.977 --> 00:04:51.936
No, Manny.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.147
I wouldn't do that if I were you.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:55.940
This isn't exactly your playground.

00:04:56.357 --> 00:04:57.942
(scoffs)

00:04:58.026 --> 00:05:00.236
Like... like I'm really
gonna be afraid of a pretty flower.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:02.781
-What?
-(Diego grunts)

00:05:02.864 --> 00:05:04.491
Bet you didn't see that coming.

00:05:04.574 --> 00:05:06.201
(both scream)

00:05:06.284 --> 00:05:07.285
Manny!

00:05:07.368 --> 00:05:09.746
For the record,
I blame you for this.

00:05:10.246 --> 00:05:11.790
(both scream)

00:05:11.873 --> 00:05:14.000
Stop eating our friends, plant.

00:05:14.083 --> 00:05:15.919
(both yelling)

00:05:17.754 --> 00:05:19.255
(both screaming)

00:05:19.798 --> 00:05:20.673
That's it.

00:05:20.757 --> 00:05:22.175
I'm tearing it up from the roots.

00:05:22.258 --> 00:05:23.301
BUCK:
Do that...

00:05:23.384 --> 00:05:25.094
and it will clamp shut forever.

00:05:25.178 --> 00:05:27.013
-What?!
-All right, preggers,

00:05:27.096 --> 00:05:28.765
don't get your trunk in a knot.

00:05:28.848 --> 00:05:30.600
I'll have them out of there
before they're digested.

00:05:30.683 --> 00:05:32.602
(screaming):
Digested?!

00:05:32.685 --> 00:05:34.395
They'll be nothing but bones
in three minutes.

00:05:34.479 --> 00:05:36.064
Well, maybe five for the fat one.

00:05:36.147 --> 00:05:38.024
MANNY:
I'm not fat.

00:05:38.107 --> 00:05:39.025
(grunting)

00:05:39.108 --> 00:05:40.568
I feel tingly.

00:05:40.652 --> 00:05:42.779
Don't say that when
you're pressed up against me.

00:05:42.862 --> 00:05:44.948
Not that kind of tingly.

00:05:45.031 --> 00:05:46.533
I-I can feel it, too.

00:05:48.076 --> 00:05:49.369
-MANNY AND DIEGO: Help!
-(Ellie gasps)

00:05:49.452 --> 00:05:51.037
-MANNY: Someone help us!
-ELLIE: Ooh...

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.038
hurry.

00:05:52.121 --> 00:05:53.873
It's time to get...

00:05:53.957 --> 00:05:56.084
Buck wild.

00:05:56.167 --> 00:05:59.045
(grunting)

00:05:59.128 --> 00:06:01.005
Ha!

00:06:03.091 --> 00:06:05.009
(groans)

00:06:05.093 --> 00:06:06.386
Who's fat now?

00:06:06.469 --> 00:06:07.804
(grunts)

00:06:07.887 --> 00:06:08.721
-Whoa.
-(grunts)

00:06:13.142 --> 00:06:14.060
Mm?

00:06:16.354 --> 00:06:17.856
(grunts)

00:06:17.939 --> 00:06:19.899
Hmm, hmm, hmm, hmm?

00:06:19.983 --> 00:06:21.025
Hmm.

00:06:21.109 --> 00:06:22.026
(grunts)

00:06:23.403 --> 00:06:25.029
(both stammering)

00:06:27.031 --> 00:06:29.367
(grunts)

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:30.451
(both straining)

00:06:30.535 --> 00:06:31.870
No.

00:06:31.953 --> 00:06:33.997
(all straining)

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.585
(rumbling)

00:06:38.668 --> 00:06:39.836
(both gasp)

00:06:39.919 --> 00:06:42.714
(straining)

00:06:42.797 --> 00:06:43.840
(whimpering)

00:06:45.884 --> 00:06:47.010
(straining)

00:06:51.264 --> 00:06:53.308
(gurgling)

00:06:54.142 --> 00:06:55.685
(gasps)

00:06:59.355 --> 00:07:00.982
(both grunt)

00:07:01.065 --> 00:07:03.234
(Manny screams)

00:07:03.318 --> 00:07:05.904
(Diego screams)

